{
  "schema": "loadsketch/brief@1",
  "id": "brief-notify",
  "title": "Brief: SMS notifications",
  "text": "A team of 2, three weeks. Other teams call your API, and you send the text message. An outside provider sends the messages; it is on the canvas already.",
  "functional": [
    "Other services can call the API to send one text message",
    "Every message must reach the provider"
  ],
  "load": [
    "500 messages a second, all writes",
    "Your callers wait 100 ms at most: the API must answer fast"
  ],
  "given": [
    "The provider takes 200 ms on average for one message, and you cannot change that",
    "Your API takes 5 ms on average for one request",
    "A worker takes 2 ms for one message, plus the wait for the provider"
  ],
  "outOfScope": [
    "Message text and templates",
    "Sending again when the provider fails",
    "Delivery reports"
  ],
  "scenario": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/scenario@1",
    "name": "Brief: SMS notifications",
    "seed": 1,
    "durationS": 60,
    "warmupS": 5,
    "traffic": { "rps": 500, "readRatio": 0 }
  },
  "limits": { "maxErrorRate": 0.01, "maxP99Ms": 100, "budgetPerMonth": 2600, "maxPoints": 6 },
  "start": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/design@1",
    "name": "Brief: SMS notifications",
    "nodes": [
      { "id": "users", "kind": "client", "label": "Users", "pos": [0, 200] },
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "SMS provider (outside)",
        "pos": [0, 380],
        "params": {
          "instances": 1,
          "concurrency": 400,
          "serviceMs": { "mean": 200, "cv": 0.5 },
          "queueLimit": 2000
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": []
  },
  "fixed": ["sms"],
  "needs": [
    { "kind": "reaches-node", "node": "sms", "text": "Messages reach the provider" },
    { "kind": "finished" },
    { "kind": "not-degraded" }
  ],
  "floors": { "worker": { "serviceMs": 2 } },
  "hint": "If the API calls the provider directly, each request waits 200 ms, so it cannot answer in 100 ms. Separate \"accept the request\" from \"send the message\": the API puts the request on a queue and answers, and workers call the provider. 500 a second × 200 ms = 100 messages in flight at a time, so the workers' concurrency must add up to more than 100.",
  "reference": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/design@1",
    "name": "Brief: SMS notifications",
    "nodes": [
      { "id": "users", "kind": "client", "label": "Users", "pos": [0, 200] },
      { "id": "lb", "kind": "load_balancer", "label": "Load balancer", "pos": [200, 200] },
      { "id": "api", "kind": "service", "label": "Notification API", "pos": [400, 200] },
      { "id": "outbox", "kind": "queue", "label": "Outgoing queue", "pos": [600, 200] },
      {
        "id": "sender",
        "kind": "worker",
        "label": "SMS sender (worker)",
        "pos": [810, 200],
        "params": { "instances": 4, "concurrency": 32, "serviceMs": { "mean": 2, "cv": 1 } }
      },
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "SMS provider (outside)",
        "pos": [1080, 200],
        "params": {
          "instances": 1,
          "concurrency": 400,
          "serviceMs": { "mean": 200, "cv": 0.5 },
          "queueLimit": 2000
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      { "from": "users", "to": "lb" },
      { "from": "lb", "to": "api" },
      { "from": "api", "to": "outbox" },
      { "from": "outbox", "to": "sender" },
      { "from": "sender", "to": "sms" }
    ]
  },
  "naive": {
    "schema": "loadsketch/design@1",
    "name": "Brief: SMS notifications",
    "nodes": [
      { "id": "users", "kind": "client", "label": "Users", "pos": [0, 200] },
      {
        "id": "api",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "Notification API",
        "pos": [540, 200],
        "params": { "instances": 4 }
      },
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "kind": "service",
        "label": "SMS provider (outside)",
        "pos": [1080, 200],
        "params": {
          "instances": 1,
          "concurrency": 400,
          "serviceMs": { "mean": 200, "cv": 0.5 },
          "queueLimit": 2000
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [{ "from": "users", "to": "api" }, { "from": "api", "to": "sms" }]
  }
}
